  (text "9 The V2 EQ (chosen stand-in)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "cbe95de9-071e-5088-9535-96b691cc0a6f"))
  (hierarchical_label "IN" (shape input) (at 20.32 50.8 180) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right)) (uuid "51a3c280-df75-561c-966c-d80779a9c7ea"))
  (text "Bass: shelf, half at 80 Hz\n(40 Hz with Bass Shift), +/-12 dB" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 53.34 124.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "bb96e236-e983-5158-98ac-de4dbd9dcc32"))
  (text "Mid: 500 Hz (1 kHz with Mid Shift)\nQ 0.72, +/-12 dB" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 109.22 147.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8151d54e-28f8-5364-a536-868a91b149fb"))
  (text "Treble: half at 2.72 kHz\n+/-12.3 dB" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 185.42 101.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c0c051b5-5b3b-5ee8-a061-7eb474ca73f1"))
  (hierarchical_label "OUT" (shape output) (at 220.98 53.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "6742a50a-6564-511f-9cea-564735dca060"))
  (text "Section 9 of the circuit notes. The later version's EQ schematic is not public; the DSP builds it from the published\nspecification [1], [3] with digital filters, and this sheet is an analogue stand-in for them, all chosen. Each band is a\ngraphic-EQ boost/cut stage: flat with its pot centred, +/-12 dB at the ends. LX1-LX4 are simulated inductors (gyrators).\nBass: low shelf at 80 Hz; Bass Shift opens SWX1, doubling the inductance for 40 Hz. Mid: 500 Hz, Q 0.7; Mid Shift is\none two-pole switch, SWX2 (closes, halving the inductance) and SWX3 (opens, halving the capacitance), for 1 kHz at the\nsame Q. Treble: high shelf at 2.8 kHz (inferred in the notes from the earlier version's tone stack).\nThe DSP's shelves are third-order and its mid band constant-Q, so the slopes here are gentler." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 198.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "91207ecb-4e87-5280-8a1b-5f230aeebfd6"))
